<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="description" content="中央競馬の各レースについて、AIが出走馬の過去成績・条件適性・市場オッズなどから1着確率を推定し、購入シミュレーションを掲載します。">
  <title>中央競馬 AI予想レース一覧 | keiba-oracle</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --status-prediction-bg: {{ status_colors.prediction.background }};
      --status-prediction-color: {{ status_colors.prediction.color }};
      --status-prediction-border: {{ status_colors.prediction.border }};
      --status-result-bg: {{ status_colors.result.background }};
      --status-result-color: {{ status_colors.result.color }};
      --status-result-border: {{ status_colors.result.border }};
      --status-pending-bg: {{ status_colors.pending.background }};
      --status-pending-color: {{ status_colors.pending.color }};
      --status-pending-border: {{ status_colors.pending.border }};
    }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: "Yu Gothic", "Hiragino Sans", sans-serif;
      background: {{ site_background }};
      color: #1f2520;
    }
    main {
      max-width: 980px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 32px 20px 56px;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      min-width: 0;
    }
    .panel {
      background: rgba(255, 253, 248, 0.96);
      border: 1px solid #d4cabd;
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(50, 89, 77, 0.06);
      min-width: 0;
    }
    .panel + .panel { margin-top: 20px; }
    .performance-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .performance-item {
      padding: 14px;
      border: 1px solid #ded6ca;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: #faf8f3;
    }
    .performance-value {
      margin-top: 8px;
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
    }
    .table-scroll {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 100%;
      overflow-x: auto;
      overscroll-behavior-inline: contain;
      -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
    }
    .index-table { min-width: 700px; }
    .nowrap {
      white-space: nowrap;
      word-break: keep-all;
    }
    th, td {
      text-align: left;
      padding: 12px 8px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #d4cabd;
    }
    th {
      color: #6f766c;
    }
    a {
      color: #32594d;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .page-link {
      color: #32594d;
      text-decoration: underline;
      text-underline-offset: 2px;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .status {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .status-prediction {
      background: var(--status-prediction-bg);
      color: var(--status-prediction-color);
      border-color: var(--status-prediction-border);
    }
    .status-result {
      background: var(--status-result-bg);
      color: var(--status-result-color);
      border-color: var(--status-result-border);
    }
    .status-pending {
      background: var(--status-pending-bg);
      color: var(--status-pending-color);
      border-color: var(--status-pending-border);
    }
    .small {
      color: #6f766c;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }
    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      main { padding: 20px 12px 40px; }
      .panel { padding: 15px; }
      .performance-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
      table { font-size: 13px; }
      th, td { padding: 8px 7px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <div class="panel">
      <h1>中央競馬 AI予想レース一覧</h1>
      <p class="small">AIが出走馬の過去成績・条件適性・市場オッズなどを分析し、各馬の1着確率を推定しています。</p>
    </div>
{% set overall = evaluation_summary.overall if evaluation_summary and evaluation_summary.overall else none %}
{% set evaluated_races = overall.evaluated_races if overall else 0 %}
    <section class="panel performance-panel">
      <h2>予測成績</h2>
      <div class="performance-grid">
        <div class="performance-item">
          <strong>現在の的中率</strong>
          <div class="performance-value">{% if evaluated_races and overall.top1_hit_rate is not none %}{{ "%.1f"|format(overall.top1_hit_rate * 100) }}%{% else %}-{% endif %}</div>
          <div class="small">{% if evaluated_races %}{{ overall.top1_hits }} / {{ evaluated_races }}レース{% else %}評価済みレースなし{% endif %}</div>
        </div>
        <div class="performance-item">
          <strong>Top3的中率</strong>
          <div class="performance-value">{% if evaluated_races and overall.top3_hit_rate is not none %}{{ "%.1f"|format(overall.top3_hit_rate * 100) }}%{% else %}-{% endif %}</div>
        </div>
        <div class="performance-item">
          <strong>Top5的中率</strong>
          <div class="performance-value">{% if evaluated_races and overall.top5_hit_rate is not none %}{{ "%.1f"|format(overall.top5_hit_rate * 100) }}%{% else %}-{% endif %}</div>
        </div>
        <div class="performance-item">
          <strong>勝ち馬の平均予想順位</strong>
          <div class="performance-value">{% if evaluated_races and overall.average_winner_predicted_rank is not none %}{{ "%.1f"|format(overall.average_winner_predicted_rank) }}位{% else %}-{% endif %}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <div class="panel">
      <div class="table-scroll">
      <table class="index-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th class="nowrap">日付</th>
            <th class="nowrap">発走</th>
            <th class="nowrap">開催場</th>
            <th>レース名</th>
            <th class="nowrap">状態</th>
            <th class="nowrap">ページ</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
{% for race in races %}
          <tr>
            <td class="nowrap">{{ race.date }}</td>
            <td class="nowrap">{{ race.start_time or "-" }}</td>
            <td class="nowrap">{{ race.track }}</td>
            <td>{{ race.race_name|e }}</td>
            <td class="nowrap"><span class="status {{ race.status_class }}">{{ race.status_label }}</span></td>
            <td class="nowrap"><a class="page-link" href="{{ race.href }}">開く</a></td>
          </tr>
{% else %}
          <tr>
            <td colspan="6">公開済みレースはまだありません。</td>
          </tr>
{% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="small">AI予想およびシミュレーション結果は、的中や利益を保証するものではありません。</p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
